Package: noxis-hw-asteroids
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: 3rr0r <https://github.com/Real3rr0r303YT>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, kmod
Recommends: rmtfs, pd-mapper, tqftpserv, qrtr-tools, modemmanager, bluez, network-manager
Description: Noxis Linux – hardware bring-up for the Nothing Phone (3a)
 Links the Android firmware (modem/dsp partitions, /vendor/firmware) into
 /lib/firmware, starts the Qualcomm remote processors (ADSP, modem, CDSP),
 signals the WLAN driver (icnss2/qca_cld3_qca6750), powers and attaches the
 WCN6750 Bluetooth controller and hands Wi-Fi and mobile data to
 NetworkManager/ModemManager (QRTR, rmtfs, pd-mapper, tqftpserv).
